Package: BetaVolume
Type: Package
Title: Geometric (Hypervolume) Measures of Beta Diversity
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Chuliang", "Song", , "clsong.ecology@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7490-8626"))
Description: Implements the geometric approach to beta diversity of Song et
    al. (2025) <doi:10.1002/ecm.70008>. A metacommunity matrix is embedded as
    a cloud of points in a hyper-dimensional space and beta diversity is the
    rescaled hypervolume of the convex hull spanned by the points and the
    origin. Provides exact (convex hull) and fast approximate (hyper-normal)
    estimators, weighted embeddings for duplicated presence/absence
    compositions, community- and species-specific contributions, corrections
    for species similarity and functional complementarity, and temporal
    change of beta diversity as hypervolume overlap.
